      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: I know what you're saying is wrong, because @gg67 posted in May that you'd addressed some of these memory leak problems in build 772, and it worked for that build. Later builds have reintroduced the horrid memory usage that is now worse than it ever was. You cut the ram usage in half with build 772, so it wasn't a small difference.",
