      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: No point in a new thread when the original is still up. I'm curious what happened in build 772 though. That was a huge difference and made everything run much better.\n\nThis is coming up again because, while the game has always used a lot of ram, it's gotten to the point that it's causing the game to stutter, audio to cut out, and eventual lockups. And it's happening faster so more people are noticing it. Hopefully  it will be better on the new build.",
      "viewerReactions": null
